<title>INDIA: Delhi shares close lower in thin trade.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares close lower in thin trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares on the Delhi Stock Exchange (DSE) closed lower in thin trade on lack of buying interest from financial institutions, brokers said.</p>
<p>The bourse's benchmark index closed 13.36 points lower at 776.01 points. The index was 783.07 at mid-session.</p>
</text>
